name: drawx
version: "1.0.0"
summary: Offline first brainstorming and whiteboard app
description: |
  DrawX is an offline-first brainstorming and whiteboard application built with Tauri v2.
  It provides an infinite canvas powered by Excalidraw, with local-first storage.
  The app runs entirely within the Flatpak sandbox, with all dependencies
  (libwebkit2gtk, libgtk-3, libwebkit2gtk-4.1, etc.) provided by the
  org.gnome.Platform runtime.

icon: drawx

platforms:
  - x86_64

requires:
  - org.gnome.Platform
  - org.freedesktop.Platform

categories:
  - graphics
  - office

license: MIT
